  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products:</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">Axaia Perfumes is a Dubai-based fragrance house specializing in high-concentration (30% perfume concentration) Extrait de Parfum. Our collections are designed to combine long-lasting performance with refined aesthetics, offering both men’s and women’s fragrances with distinctive bottle designs, including our signature Pearl Cloud Collection.</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">Products: </p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><u>Woman fragrances : </u></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">Sunset vanilla</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">Sweet Savour</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><u>Men fragrances:</u></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">Noir Luxe Leather</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">Amaris vanilla </p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">Imperial Oud Tobacco</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">Imperial Oud Sandalwood</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• What makes us different:</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">High oil concentration (Extrait de Parfum)</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">Woman bottle unique aesthetic</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">Strong customer feedback from retail activations of scent longevity and projection</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• How affiliates can earn:</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">Affiliates earn commission on every successful sale generated through their unique link or discount code. We provide creative assets, product visuals, and launch campaigns to help maximize conversions.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• How to promote us:</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">Affiliates can promote via social media content, reviews, storytelling, lifestyle posts, and personal fragrance recommendations.</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\">We are building a long-term network of creators who align with quality, ambition, and authenticity.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• Other information:</p></div></div>",
